<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 590.03, up 1.04.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 287 to 247.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.03.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 25,746,380, compared with 25,979,190 Wednesday.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1330 EST/1830 GMT)</p>
</text>
